incoming.problem:
run leaves these semantics undefined:
- the working directory;
- that run=[argv] has no shell, so globs like 'ls {state}/soak-*.txt' never expand;
- whether who=you cmds are executed;
- which steps need a --script answer;
- --dry-run;
- what counts as ok for a background cmd;
- timeouts;
- how expect is matched;
- literal braces (Done-when text and regexes can contain {..}, which become unknown-placeholder errors).
